        "kind": "rcore",
        "text": "rcore 1;\npackage `g` version \"1\";\nmetamodel \"urn:g\" prefix `g` {\n  class `Value` {\n    attr `name`: EString [0,1] default \"new\";\n  }\n  class `Other` {\n  }\n  class `Box`<`T`> {\n    ref `value`: generic parameter \"#//@eClassifiers.2/@eTypeParameters.0\" [0,1];\n    op `accept`(`input`: generic parameter \"#//@eClassifiers.2/@eTypeParameters.0\" [0,1]) -> void;\n  }\n  class `ValueBox` extends generic external \"#//@eClassifiers.2\"<external \"#//@eClassifiers.0\"> {\n  }\n  class `Root` {\n    ref `values`: external \"#//@eClassifiers.0\" [0,*] containment;\n    ref `boxes`: external \"#//@eClassifiers.3\" [0,*] containment;\n    attr `valueCount`: EInt [0,1] derived;\n  }\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "dependencies": [
          {
            "sha256": "9c55f9faf2ed02c8a122250efd9ab80ba39bbd86161cbe01e6d63d5c587db418",
            "uri": "memory:generic.ecore.rcore"
          }
        ],
        "id": {
          "sha256": "c7f876f692b14bca0251e4fb83397b3342b07bb274660483c4c2c2357ad0f90f",
          "uri": "memory:generic.xtext"
        },
        "kind": "xtext",
        "text": "grammar example.Generic import \"urn:g\" as g\nRoot returns g::Root: 'root' '{' (values+=Value | boxes+=ValueBox)* '}';\nValue returns g::Value: 'value' name=ID ';';\nValueBox returns g::ValueBox: 'box' value=[g::Value|ID] ';';\n"
      },
      {
        "dependencies": [
          {
            "sha256": "9c55f9faf2ed02c8a122250efd9ab80ba39bbd86161cbe01e6d63d5c587db418",
            "uri": "memory:generic.ecore.rcore"
          }
        ],
        "id": {
          "sha256": "2b3c8027151d5a464e738715daba30893059f24622757533e9091bd6167d1d8e",
          "uri": "memory:generic-behavior.rcore"
        },
        "kind": "rcore_behavior",
        "text": "rcore 1;\npackage fixtureProviders version \"1\";\nimport model \"urn:g\" as m;\nderive m.`Root`.`valueCount` using count(`values`);\n"
      }
